  description: '2 Level 4 Spellcaster monsters

    While this card is an Equip
    Card, the equipped monster can make up to 2 attacks on monsters during each Battle
    Phase. You can only use each of the following effects of "Ninaruru, the Magistus
    Glass Goddess" once per turn. You can detach 1 material from this card, then
    target 1 Level 4 or higher Spellcaster monster in your GY; add it to your hand.
    While this card is equipped to a monster: You can target 1 "Magistus" card in
    your Spell & Trap Zone and 1 Spell/Trap your opponent controls; destroy them.'
